    "Re-run the Wayback Machine CDX query later to confirm no legacy or abandoned subdomains/paths remain reachable",
    "Continue monitoring Certificate Transparency for unauthorized certificates issued for wikipedia.org and its subdomains",
    "Treat the single malicious VirusTotal community vote as noise but keep periodic reputation monitoring given the domain's attractiveness for brand impersonation",
